 "_note": "The two dumps tools/fill_tests.py admits per test are both the MERGED dump esm_dump_scm_suite_900.json, written by tools/merge_dumps.py from the three driver-level subassembly dumps of WRF step 900 (all/pbl/rad) and the four kernel dumps of the same step (sfclayrev, sw, ysu, rrtm at kernel call 1800); a variable is named <tag>_<wrf name>. The mount-edge libraries under couplings/tests/ are written by the `libraries` list and are NOT imported by the test itself: the coupled document injects them at the mount edges (esm-spec 9.7.10).",
